h-20261019\nnext_step: No active assignment; use the companion when considering a separately selected manuscript route.\nSources: topics/products/pentagon-affine-products/circle-deficit-explanation-20261019.md, topics/products/pentagon-affine-products/circle-deficit-review-20261019.md\n\nTen-minute preliminary check of local-cover continuum proof\nBounded continuum inspection complete: no concrete fatal gap found in sections 1 and 3; explicit crossing/deletion/winding and compactness lemmas retained, with simultaneous-translation clarification. No overall theorem approval or fresh certificate execution.\nproject: research-20261022\nauthorization: Root admitted a bounded scientific preliminary on 22 October 2026, up to ten minutes from 08:42:37 UTC, with checkpoint by 08:52:37 UTC. Read/reason only; no numerical producer, build or manuscript change. Prior campaign budgets are not active.\nnext_step: If selected, independently review explicit loop lemma and finite-certificate interface before assembled proof acceptance. No automatic continuation.\nSources: topics/products/pentagon-arbitrary-partner/local-cover-rigidity.md, topics/products/pentagon-arbitrary-partner/local-cover/preliminary-continuum-check-20261022.md\n\nIndependent local-cover continuum and certificate-interface review\nIndependent disk/chord continuum proof, positive-marginal coercivity, arbitrary-body transfer and source-checked BMP applicability establish local fixed-pentagon arbitrary-partner result relative to imported theorem. Fresh exact finite rerun passed. No global optimum, human acceptance or manuscript promotion.\nproject: research-20261022\nauthorization: Fresh user instruction f-0e56f2f60f6d40a39c5f2c1c9b5aa2a2 saved 13:33:17.571647UTC authorizes starting prepared research regardless Workbench readiness. Astra high actual read started 13:40:03UTC; initial 20–35 min scope, latest stop 14:15:03UTC. No inherited 19 October budget. Quota effect unknown; walltime and attention remain costs.\nn