cy for this slice.\nSources: thesis/chapters/10b-symmetric-partners.tex, thesis/chapters/01-introduction.tex, thesis/chapters/16-conclusion.tex, meta-topics/project-management/selected-partner-navigation-20261022.md\n\nFind the next exact contact obstruction for the 5×7 affine systolic maximum\nReviewed explicit5×7 witness gives det>1.0063055 and gain over best rotation>0.0042; root edge-reduction theorem proved; sharp optimum remains open.\nproject: journal-sprint-20261022\nauthorization: Within the user-stated sprint ending 2026-10-22T20:53:54Z; finite source reasoning and bounded exact checks only as selected by coordinator. User-reported unlimited API/agent/recursion capacity is not measured quota.\nnext_step: Further research or full paper drafting requires a new selected continuation.\nSources: topics/products/pentagon-affine-products/affine-witness-20261022/finding.md, topics/products/pentagon-affine-products/determinant-edge-reduction.md\n\nAssess a global arbitrary-partner cover obstruction or structural bound\nReviewed balanced-Hessian necessary contact condition; global cover problem remains open.\nproject: journal-sprint-20261022\nauthorization: Within the user-stated sprint ending 2026-10-22T20:53:54Z; bounded source reasoning only unless coordinator records otherwise. User-reported unlimited API/agent/recursion capacity is not measured quota.\nnext_step: Further research or full paper drafting requires a new selected continuation.\nSources: topics/products/pentagon-arbitrary-partner/block-hessian-lemma-20261022.md\n\nTest the next odd-pair full-tensor containment case\nIndependent review and fresh replay passed7×7 and5×9 certificates; sharp independent-affine7×7 bound and equality derived.\nproject: journal-sprint-20261022\nauthorization: Within the user-stated sprint ending 2026-10-22T20:53:54Z; certificate work bounded by coordinator. User-reported unlimited API/agent/recursion capacity is not measured quota.\nnext_step: Further research or full pape