56 a87d422c1ee43ca10454b5c7fa25eeb3f35f1b9ea424734aa501fe6c7e13f0b3; no defects found. Root retaining layout report.\nproject: research-20261028\nauthorization: Selected within the active local autonomous research envelope ending 2026-10-29 10:05 UTC; root owns integration acceptance, commits and delivery.\nSources: topics/capacity-and-qp/convex-systolic-optimization/paper.pdf, topics/capacity-and-qp/convex-systolic-optimization/reviews/\n\nSubstantially stronger HKO-descended body\nFixed HKO t=3/10 twenty-facet theorem: exact capacity c/c_H=1019/1025, exact volume and ratio 1.0519141388294875... above HKO. Independent coverage/volume audit and fresh-copy full replay PASS; no family maximum or monotonicity claim.\nproject: research-20261028\nauthorization: Selected within the active local autonomous research envelope ending 2026-10-29 10:05 UTC; root owns integration acceptance, commits and delivery.\nSources: topics/capacity-and-qp/convex-systolic-optimization/sections/hko-moderate.tex, topics/capacity-and-qp/convex-systolic-optimization/certificates/hko-t03/README.md\n\nTriangle product position separation\nFresh audit passes sharp 2/3 bound for Lagrangian positions of two triangles and rational non-Lagrangian affine example ratio18/25; no full-affine optimum. Module handed to paper worker.\nproject: research-20261028\nauthorization: Selected within the active local autonomous research envelope ending 2026-10-29 10:05 UTC; root owns integration acceptance, commits and delivery.\nSources: PLAN.md\n\nIndependent 20-facet HKO ascent audit\nIndependent analytic audit passed unrestricted 20-facet ascent and later two-hinge first-order obstruction for at most two characteristic-invariant affine hinges with original rows retained. These do not establish an arbitrary twelve-facet neighborhood theorem.\nproject: research-20261028\nauthorization: Selected within the active local autonomous research envelope ending 2026-10-29 10:05 UTC; root owns integration acceptance, commits and delivery.\nSources: topics/capacity-and-qp/convex-systolic-optimization/reviews/hko-ascent-mathematics.md, topics/capacity-and-qp/convex-systolic-optimization/reviews/hko-two-hinge-mathematics.md\n\nIndependent all-dimensional difference-volume audit\nAll-dimensional two-confocal-paraboloid theorem, strictness, sharp limit and planar squared-body specialization passed fresh audit.\nproject: research-20261028\nauthorization: Selected within the active local autonomous research envelope ending 2026-10-29 10:05 UTC; root owns integration acceptance, commits and delivery.\nSources: PLAN.md\n\nIndependent all-partner product theorem audit\nStrict all-convex-partner theorem passed fresh lattice-cover/forest/covariogram audit; open-neighborhood corollary separately checked.\nproject: research-20261028\nauthorization: Selected within the active local autonomous research envelope ending 2026-10-29 10:05 UTC; root owns integration acceptance, commits and delivery.\nSources: PLAN.md\n\nIndependent assembled paper reader/value/source review\nFinal exact-hash r6 reader PASS with companion, after printed Appendix B, updated hko-t03 evidence status and retained-row scope phrase. Reader review did not replace root all-page visual check or mathematical review.\nproject: research-20261028\nauthorization: Selected by active research coordinator for final assembled paper assessment within local research envelope; root owns acceptance.\nSources: topics/capacity-and-qp/convex-systolic-optimization/reviews/REVIEW-r6.md\n\nAudited 17-facet derivative and effective HKO witness\nWeighted-profile response max(w)/125 gives local ascent from any seven selected unit cuts and 17 facets; six-cut limit holds only for these fixed profiles. Printed Appendix B gives full quantitative proof of gain >t/200 for all ten unit cuts at 0<t<=10^-30; finite checks in companion.\nproject: research-20261028\nauthorization: Selected local research within the active autonomous research envelope; component result for r3 paper.\nSources: topics/capacity-and-qp/convex-systolic-optimization/sections/hko-seventeen-facets.tex, topics/capacity-and-qp/convex-systolic-optimization/sections/hko-effective-step.tex\n\nTest two arbitrary characteristic-invariant hinges for 12-facet ascent\nExact analytic obstruction: with all ten original HKO facet inequalities retained, at most two added characteristic-invariant affine hinges have nonpositive first logarithmic systolic variation, even on the same facet. Higher-order zero directions, non-invariant hinges and arbitrary twelve-facet local maximality remain open.\nproject: research-20261028\nauthorization: Root selected a bounded two-hinge discriminator within the active local research envelope; completed and reviewed, with no further research selected.\nSources: topics/capacity-and-qp/convex-systolic-optimization/sections/hko-two-hinge-main.tex, topics/capacity-and-qp/convex-systolic-optimization/sections/hko-two-hinge-appendix.tex, topics/capacity-and-qp/convex-systolic-optimization/reviews/hko-two-hinge-mathematics.md\n\nIndependent moderate HKO mathematical coverage and volume audit\nIndependent mathematical audit PASS for fixed t=3/10 exact capacity coverage, Haim-Kislev minimizer premise, Lawrence volume formula, 20 facets/75 simple vertices and strict ratio comparison.\nproject: research-20261028\nauthorization: Selected within active local autonomous research envelope; root owns integration, commits and delivery.\nSources: topics/capacity-and-qp/convex-systolic-optimization/reviews/hko-t03-mathematics.md, topics/capacity-and-qp/convex-systolic-optimization/reviews/hko-t03-volume-source.md\n\nFrozen fresh-copy moderate HKO replay\nIndependent fresh-copy exact replay PASS for frozen t=3/10 packet: 77,927 curvature exclusions, 2,326 leaf classes, geometry/volume and ratio assertions; altered controls rejected.\nproject: research-20261028\nauthorization: Selected within active local autonomous research envelope; root owns integration, commits and delivery.\nSources: topics/capacity-and-qp/convex-systolic-optimization/reviews/hko-t03-independent-replay.md, topics/capacity-and-qp/convex-systolic-optimization/certificates/hko-t03/README.md\n\nSource ZIP, manifest, replay and verified link\nCompleted final r6 56-page research PDF and source/evidence ZIP. Exact-hash assembled mathematical and reader PASS; root all-page visual check; 165/165 archive hashes and nested manifests; independent extracted-copy fast replays and warning-free LaTeX build; final HTTP PDF/ZIP hashes match. Scope and verification limits are retained in the delivery record. Local integration complete; no selected thesis edit or external publication.\nproject: research-20261028\nauthorization: Selected within active local autonomous research envelope; root owns integration, commits and delivery.\nnext_step: No automatic continuation. Any thesis adoption or new research requires a separately selected task.\nSources: topics/capacity-and-qp/convex-systolic-optimization/README.md, topics/capacity-and-qp/convex-systolic-optimization/paper.pdf, docs/file-viewer.md, topics/capacity-and-qp/convex-systolic-optimization/source-and-evidence.zip, topics/capacity-and-qp/convex-systolic-optimization-delivery.md\n\nFinal research results have durable discovery routes\nRepaired guide, product/variation accounts, research-frontier HTML and separate-research thesis-dashboard wording. Fresh reader followed source/proof/review paths and recovered exact scopes;219local relative target checks pass; representative HTTP bytes match; wide/narrow local Chrome renders inspected. Frozen paper/ZIP/selected thesis unchanged. Full dashboard validator still has known pre-existing obsolete-source reference.\nproject: research-20261028\nauthorization: Fleet orchestrator delegation29Oct07:37: proportionate maintained discovery repairs in research worktree; no main merge/thesis promotion/publication/proof rerun.\nnext_step: Fleet root receives committed repair;